			description: [
				"Bounty Harvest uses 15 economic levels. Level 1 is granted automatically when you join."
				""
				"For each later level, finish the current Market Order and then complete the next promotion contract. The new GameStage is auto-claimed, and the promotion quest awards that level's first decree."
				""
				"Each level adds a crop, animal, processor, machine, cuisine, or expedition. Older goods remain useful in later recipes and bounty pools, so expanding the farm is better than abandoning yesterday's production."
			]
			icon: "bountiful:bountyboard"
			id: "E60381A75A8C4D21"
